{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 77413, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 55279, "uid": 75614, "type": 4, "title": "天子升星方法", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1622640111, "updated_at": 1622640462, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1677987093, "last_at": 1682950277, "comment_count": 14, "status": 1, "summary": "1.前言天命之子中，角色的升星，是提升队伍战斗力重要途径。活动前提前规划好进化材料与金币，可以有效防止出现进化资源不足的窘迫境况。同时，合理利用低星天子升星，在五星天子进化时，代替所需原生五星天子，可", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 15, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 58381, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 17, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 77413, "content": "<div style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 14px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"margin:0px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:20px;\">1.前言</span></p></div>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">天命之子中，角色的升星，是提升队伍战斗力重要途径。活动前提前规划好进化材料与金币，可以有效防止出现进化资源不足的窘迫境况。同时，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">合理利用低星天子升星，在五星天子进化时，代替所需原生五星天子，可以极大节省原生五星天子</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">【</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">小知识：天命之子游戏中，所有天子都可以通过满级升星的方式升到六星，而一开始就星级就为五颗星的天子，被称为原生五星（胎五）</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">】</span></span></div><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-weight: 700;\"><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 韩服目前处在点火版本，点火石的制作天子材料限定为原生五星，因此对于萌新，就算已经+6溢出的天子也必须屯好，尽量节省原生五星的开销</span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"></span></span><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;\">请萌新不要在还魂或者五星天子升六星时，消耗原生五星天子！</span><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"margin:0px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">2.数据汇总</span></p></div></span></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"margin:0px;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614172820903_25043517.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614172820903_25043517.png\" alt=\"天子升星所需资源与升星方法\" style=\"margin:0px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"margin:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-weight: 700;\">值得一提的是，合成高级进化素材非常耗费金币，因此建议萌新</span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:24px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">除非紧迫，不要强行使用低级进化素材合成高级材料</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: 700;\">【<span>这也再次说明， 活动之前早点规划的重要性</span>】</span></span></div><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px10px;width:calc(100%-6px);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"margin:0px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,255,255);\">3.结论</span></p></div></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:start;text-indent:0px;font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; 天命之子的主流队伍绝大部分都由原生五星组成</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700;\">，而由上图可知，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700;\">四星升到五星，比三星升到五星，要少消耗进化素材【也会节省大量金币】</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700;\">，因此建议萌新：</span><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\"></span></div></span><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;\">练四星天子到满级升星后，代替<span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:24px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-size:24px;\">原生</span></span>五星天子，来进行满级五星天子升六星</span></span></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\">ps：胎五溢出的老咸鱼可以无视了<br></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;\"></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><span style=\"margin:0px;\"><p style=\"margin:0px;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-indent:0px;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:16px;\">——ID：xiaoxin</font></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);text-indent:0px;text-align:right;\"><font size=\"3\" style=\"margin:0px;font-size:16px;\">2021.6.2</font></p></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 75614, "username": "xiaoxin", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "玩游戏就是要开心嘛", "follow_num": 250, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 2, "content_at": 97439232, "content_num": 79, "read_num": 1317678, "like_num": 1138}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.ga